{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20141","headline":"送卢郎中汀 · 孟郊","name":"送卢郎中汀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛水春渡阔，别离心悠悠。\n一生空吟诗，不觉成白头。\n向事每计较，与山实绸缪。\n太华天上开，其下车辙流。\n县街无尘土，过客多淹留。\n坐饮孤驿酒，行思独山游。\n逸关岚气明，照渭空漪浮。\n玉珂摆新欢，声与鸾凤俦。\n朝谒大家事，唯余去无由。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}